---
kind: scene
id: common.eve
title: The girl at the lakeshore
on: slotStart
when: "run.day == 5 && run.slot == 'evening'"
priority: 20
after: 'visited("common.exam")'
---

## Lakeshore

::bg{location="lakeshore" time="evening"}
::music{action="start" mood="peaceful" volume="down"}
::auto{character="hotaru" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@narrator: A girl in an old-fashioned uniform is sitting on the jetty, lighting lanterns nobody asked her to light.
@hotaru{emotion="smiling"}: You can see me. Most transfers can't, the first week.

<match on="user.terms">
  <when is="0">
    @hotaru: I'm Hotaru. I keep the lanterns. Tomorrow the whole school floats them, and every one of them comes back to me.
    @you: Comes back?
    @hotaru{emotion="sad"}: The lake is round. Everything comes back.
  </when>
  <when is="1">
    @hotaru{emotion="fond"}: You again. One lantern on this lake is yours, did you know? I keep count.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @hotaru{emotion="fond"}: You again. {{user.terms}} lanterns on this lake are yours, did you know? I keep count.
  </otherwise>
</match>

<match on="prev.run.ending">
  <when is="good">
    @hotaru{emotion="neutral"}: Last time it was {{prev.run.route}}'s lantern. It came back to me warm.
  </when>
  <when is="bittersweet">
    @hotaru{emotion="sad"}: Last time it was {{prev.run.route}}'s lantern. It came back to me with the flame guttering.
  </when>
  <when is="solo">
    @hotaru{emotion="sad"}: Last time you floated yours alone. It came back to me cold.
  </when>
  <when is="keeper">
    @hotaru{emotion="neutral"}: They tell me I used to keep these. I don't remember it. You look as if you do.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator: Out on the water, the first test lanterns bob and turn.
  </otherwise>
</match>

@hotaru{emotion="fond" when="quest.fourLanterns.state == 'complete' && !holds('cgSeen', ['cgKeeperEnd'])"}: Four lanterns, four people. You've given this lake everyone but me. Tomorrow... float one for me?
::auto{character="hotaru" action="fadeOut"}
